## Strategic Recommendations

### 1. /members Page: All Members Listed + Elite Badge

**Recommendation: Show all members. Add a visible Elite badge.**

| Approach | Pros | Cons |
|---|---|---|
| ❌ Elite only | Creates exclusivity | Kills social proof. Firms see a ghost town. Fewer-tier members feel excluded. |
| ❌ All members, no distinction | More profiles = more social proof | No reason to upgrade. Elite members feel invisible. |
| ✅ **All members + Elite badge** | Social proof stays high. Elite members stand out. Aspiration drives upgrades. | None — this is industry standard. |

**How it works with your trust score:**
- Trust score = *capability signal* (training completed, background check passed)
- Elite badge = *commitment signal* (this person invested $97/mo in their career)
- Together they tell firms: "This person is both trained AND serious."

**Implementation:** Add `subscription_tier` to the members API query. Display a copper/gold `ELITE` badge next to the verified badge on member cards. Firms scanning the directory will immediately see who's all-in.

